# Karma v1 (design/data/karma.toml, karma/*.js). Each bot fakes its Life 1 deeds with `ttl karma <bot> set`
# (counted from the bot's Life 1 start, so scores left over from earlier runs don't count), dies, and the
# Corridor must judge it and roll offers for its tier. `ttl karma <bot> expect <field> <value>` prints
# "ttl: ..." when the value is wrong, which `server.sh test-all` counts as a failure.
# Expect in the log: "[ttl] karma: TtlBotKarmaU judged underdog", "...H judged elite", "...L judged legendary",
# "...N judged elite" (no boss, so no Legend), "...D judged normal (dark)".
ttlbot spawn TtlBotKarmaU
ttlbot spawn TtlBotKarmaH
ttlbot spawn TtlBotKarmaL
ttlbot spawn TtlBotKarmaN
ttlbot spawn TtlBotKarmaD
@sleep 2
# A fresh Life 1 has done nothing yet: the live preview says underdog.
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaU
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaU expect tier underdog
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaU expect phase life1
# Hero: 10 hours, the Nether, trade, diamonds, enchanting, advancements — no boss.
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaH set play_time 720000
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaH set mob_kills 300
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaH set far 3000
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaH set nether 1
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaH set trades 60
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaH set deepslate_diamond_ore 30
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaH set enchants 15
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaH set advancements 35
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaH expect tier elite
# Legend: a long life with the Ender Dragon and the Wither.
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaL set play_time 900000
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaL set mob_kills 800
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaL set far 6000
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaL set nether 1
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaL set end 1
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaL set ender_dragon 1
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaL set wither 1
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaL set trades 200
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaL set raids_won 2
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaL set deepslate_diamond_ore 60
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaL set ancient_debris 10
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaL set enchants 50
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaL set advancements 60
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaL expect tier legendary
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaL expect bosses 2
# The same life without a boss stays a Hero (min_bosses = 1).
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaN set play_time 900000
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaN set mob_kills 800
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaN set far 6000
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaN set nether 1
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaN set end 1
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaN set trades 200
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaN set raids_won 2
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaN set deepslate_diamond_ore 60
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaN set ancient_debris 10
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaN set enchants 50
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaN set advancements 60
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaN expect tier elite
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaN expect bosses 0
# Dark: a few hours and eight villagers murdered.
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaD set play_time 216000
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaD set mob_kills 60
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaD set villagers 8
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaD set advancements 10
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaD expect tier normal
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaD expect dark true
# Death: the verdict is stored and the offers follow the tier (Slime + 1 / 3 / 4 for underdog / hero / legend).
kill TtlBotKarmaU
kill TtlBotKarmaH
kill TtlBotKarmaL
kill TtlBotKarmaN
kill TtlBotKarmaD
@sleep 1
ttl inspect TtlBotKarmaH
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaH
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaU expect phase corridor
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaU expect tier underdog
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaU expect offers 2
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaH expect tier elite
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaH expect offers 4
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaL expect tier legendary
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaL expect offers 5
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaN expect offers 4
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaD expect dark true
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaD expect offers 3
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaD expect darkoffer true
# Uniques: a Hero picks 1 of 3 without the Trial; an underdog gets a random one and is reborn at once.
execute as TtlBotKarmaH run ttl wish knowledge
execute as TtlBotKarmaH run ttl choose slime
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaH expect step unique
execute as TtlBotKarmaU run ttl wish knowledge
execute as TtlBotKarmaU run ttl choose slime
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaU expect phase life2
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaU expect bonus 0
# Unique odds by tier (karma.toml weights). The Protection pool mixes 3 Common + 2 Rare; with every unique free
# the rare share is ~18% (underdog 3:1 common), ~57% (hero 1:2) and ~73% (legend 1:4). "ttl: ..." when off by > 10 points.
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaU odds protection
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaN odds protection
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaL odds protection
# A Legend picks 1 of 3 and is reborn carrying one bonus non-unique skill (karma.toml bonus_skills, Voice line).
execute as TtlBotKarmaL run ttl wish knowledge
execute as TtlBotKarmaL run ttl choose slime
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaL expect step unique
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaL pick
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaL expect phase life2
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaL expect bonus 1
ttl inspect TtlBotKarmaL
# Karma survives the rebirth; /ttl reset starts a new Life 1 with a clean slate.
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaU expect tier underdog
ttl reset TtlBotKarmaH
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaH expect phase life1
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaH expect tier underdog
ttl reset TtlBotKarmaU
ttl reset TtlBotKarmaL
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaL expect bonus 0
ttl reset TtlBotKarmaN
ttl reset TtlBotKarmaD
ttlbot remove TtlBotKarmaU
ttlbot remove TtlBotKarmaH
ttlbot remove TtlBotKarmaL
ttlbot remove TtlBotKarmaN
ttlbot remove TtlBotKarmaD
# Anti-farming (karma.toml [activity], [explore], [kill_cap]). TtlBotKarmaF starts a clean Life 1 (ttl reset).
# `sample` runs one activity sample as if the 20 s timer fired (400 ticks when the bot was active), `act` marks an
# action (breaking, placing, using, chat) since the last sample. Bots do not move on their own, so idle samples
# must add nothing.
ttlbot spawn TtlBotKarmaF
@sleep 2
ttl reset TtlBotKarmaF
# Exploration: distinct 64x64 squares, 64 "blocks" each, at most 30 new squares per day.
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaF expect far 0
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaF explore 100 100
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaF expect far 64
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaF explore 110 120
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaF expect far 64
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaF explore 1000 1000
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaF expect far 128
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaF explore 5000 5000 40
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaF expect cells 30
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaF expect far 1920
# Kills: 100000 kills of nothing in particular count as 200 (other_max); 400 zombies count as 80 (max per kind).
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaF set mob_kills 100000
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaF expect kills 200
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaF set kill.zombie 400
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaF set mob_kills 400
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaF expect kills 80
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaF set kill.zombie 0
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaF set mob_kills 50
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaF expect kills 50
# Active time: the first sample takes a baseline, an idle sample adds nothing, an action or 2+ blocks moved adds 400.
# The baseline is taken after the bot has landed and the counter is zeroed after it: a fresh bot that is still falling
# from its spawn (the Lerfing world, verify 20/11), or the 5-minute timer sampling it first, added 400 to "idle".
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaF sample
@sleep 3
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaF sample
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaF set play_time 0
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaF sample
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaF expect active 0
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaF act
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaF sample
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaF expect active 400
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaF sample
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaF expect active 400
# Sideways: a bot teleported up falls back to where it was before the sample runs.
execute as TtlBotKarmaF at @s run tp @s ~3 ~ ~
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaF sample
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaF expect active 800
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaF sample
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaF expect active 800
ttl reset TtlBotKarmaF
ttl karma TtlBotKarmaF expect active 0
ttlbot remove TtlBotKarmaF
